msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Choose a game's folder: it goes to PC5's INSTALL folder, then PC5 asks to "
"install it."
msgstr ""
"Elige la carpeta de un juego: va a la carpeta INSTALL de PC5 y luego PC5 "
"pregunta si quieres instalarlo."

